Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it was smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.78,0:00:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.78,0:00:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is really awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.22,0:00:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so this was gifted\Nto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,me by the Jackson\Nestate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.64,0:00:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And I never got to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael Jackson, but he\Nwas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.22,0:00:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,my very first concert\Nand my
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,favorite artist as a\Nkid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.48,0:00:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So having a Michael\NJackson
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,drawing out Mickey in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.66,0:00:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Fantasia, this is not a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.86,0:00:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,print, this is an actual
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.78,0:00:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,piece by him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is like so special\Nfor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got this massive\NMongol
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,wall that we're standing\Nin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.54,0:00:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,front of right now.
